# icn_cset_canon NUL-scans and collapses; codegen bakes CSETVAL's slen=-1 sentinel, deferring to
# runtime strlen()) -- see FINDING-2026-08-27-seat09-icon-cset-embedded-nul-is-a-four-layer-representation-gap.md
procedure main()
